From 8bf12aab37db040f6f799f64cfd86b8831929cab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sardi-dev <134648583+sardi-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:24:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/25] Add the Tiger's Peak arena

The arena had a template row and a start location but no class, so no
match could be created on it. Add the class, modelled on the Tol'viron
arena: two gates that open when the match starts and two Shadow Sight
buffs that appear a minute later. Players who fall below the map are
returned to the middle of it. The arena counters are sent through the
initial world states of its zone, and the arena joins the random arena
selection with the weight of its template row.

Based on Legends of Azeroth 5.4.8.
